    - target: {fileID: 5905881967701677635, guid: 3938ed1ae5c23814f8817ead1ed0d3bf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'This scene gives an example of sending events within the behavior tree.
        A global event is sent when the turret projectile hits the agent in order
        to summon the medic for aid. A local event is then sent from the medic to
        the agent after aid has been given.


        See this page for more information
        on events:

        https://opsive.com/support/documentation/behavior-designer-pro/events

'
